  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Two orthogonal dimensions",
      "items": [
        "Dimension 1 is the split: LP 65% / protocol 35% (fixed)",
        "Dimension 2 routes the protocol share by denomination",
        "Stacked, the two dimensions give a fee's full destination"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Referrals and executors",
      "items": [
        "With a referrer, the rebate is carved from the protocol share (default 10% of the total fee, adjustable), leaving the protocol treasury about 25%",
        "0.25% of primary-pool uAsset fees (current default) goes to the executor who triggers distribution",
        "Locked-phase aux-pool fees (POL/uAsset, PT/uAsset, PT/POL): part shared with standard Genesis participants pro rata by share, the rest to the DAO treasury"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Don't confuse the three treasuries",
      "items": [
        "Memecoin-denominated fees go to the staking YieldVault (stakers)",
        "uAsset-denominated fees go to the DAO treasury (community)",
        "Leverage interest goes to the protocol treasury, not a trading fee"
      ]
    }
